{"id":"vod_sn_37441","vodId":"37441","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"偶像荣耀","name_cn":"偶像荣耀","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/041fc1b54577af4c384bd0c09ee974a1.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在位于关东郊外的星见市，该市以“最适合观测一年一度的流星雨的城市”为由闻名于世。星见演艺事务所中，偶像长濑麻奈（神田沙也加 配音）因为在演绎对决中连连获胜，而在偶像排行榜维纳斯计划中一路扶摇直上。　　几年后，事务所开始收纳新的偶像，麻奈的妹妹琴乃（橘美来 配音）和拥有着和麻奈极为相似的歌声的川咲樱（菅野真衣 配音）是其中最有望复刻麻奈曾经的辉煌的所在。除此之外，拥有超强舞技个性却略微冷淡的一之濑怜（结城萌子 配音）、性格温柔，总是替别人着想的伊吹渚（夏目心菜 配音）、无论何时都可以依靠的大姐姐佐伯遥子（佐佐木奈绪 配音） ，同样在努力着的，还有这些预备偶像们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/67z8Wg9YH81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YnPHbcCkfN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Vxw3S3qY471/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r7i6uL19FJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nqEsmL7b161/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4YuWXBz5iq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0a2HCayCVD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DT20tXP3j41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JYLKFjfYGe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZWxJqdb5UD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bFCzKrRuDL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LRkfBWMPYr1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:10.798Z"}